0,\\\"\\\"],[41,\\\"      if (ollamaSettings?.useOllama) {\\\"],[42,\\\"        console.log(`[DEBUG] AgentManager: Creating OllamaProvider (${ollamaSettings.ollamaModel})`);\\\"],[43,\\\"        Logger.info(`🦙 Initializing with Ollama provider (${ollamaSettings.ollamaModel})...`);\\\"]],\\\"next_start\\\":44,\\\"omissions\\\":[],\\\"omitted_cards\\\":0,\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S2\\\",\\\"start\\\":20,\\\"total_lines\\\":90,\\\"v\\\":3,\\\"view_id\\\":\\\"c8d335380559d7537ccd89c15ea5c40b38f86b4e526111a520976e70268ccac9\\\"}\",\"role\":\"user\"},{\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"ultima_work_research_inspect\\\",\\\"action_input\\\":{\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S3\\\",\\\"start_line\\\":25}}\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},{\"content\":\"Observation: {\\\"cards\\\":[[\\\"N3.2f5667099d7343dd\\\",\\\"code\\\",\\\"Logger.info\\\",25,25,25,29],[\\\"N3.f035c0e446d07b9a\\\",\\\"code\\\",\\\"Date.now\\\",37,37,34,41],[\\\"N3.aa273a1fbf501b46\\\",\\\"code\\\",\\\"Logger.info\\\",40,40,37,44]],\\\"end\\\":48,\\\"lines\\\":[[25,\\\"        Logger.info(`🤖 [UnifiedAgent] Initialized with ${this.provider.name} provider and ${this.toolRegistry.size} tools`);\\\"],[26,\\\"    }\\\"],[27,\\\"\\\"],[28,\\\"    /**\\\"],[29,\\\"     * Process a user query\\\"],[30,\\\"     * Uses function calling to determine if a tool should be used\\\"],[31,\\\"     */\\\"],[32,\\\"    async processQuery(\\\"],[33,\\\"        query: string,\\\"],[34,\\\"        sessionId?: string,\\\"],[35,\\\"        userContext?: { userId?: string; displayName?: string; email?: string }\\\"],[36,\\\"    ): Promise<string> {\\\"],[37,\\\"        const startTime = Date.now();\\\"],[38,\\\"\\\"],[39,\\\"        try {\\\"],[40,\\\"            Logger.info(`📥 [UnifiedAgent] Processing query: \\\\\\\"${query.substring(0, 50)}...\\\\\\\"`);\\\"],[41,\\\"\\\"],[42,\\\"            // If the provider supports tool calling, use it\\\"],[43,\\\"            if (this.provider.supportsToolCalling()) {\\\"],[44,\\\"                return await this.processWithTools(query, startTime);\\\"],[45,\\\"            }\\\"],[46,\\\"\\\"],[47,\\\"            // Fallback to text generation for providers without tool support\\\"],[48,\\\"            return await this.processTextOnly(query, startTime);\\\"]],\\\"next_start\\\":49,\\\"omissions\\\":[],\\\"omitted_cards\\\":0,\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S3\\\",\\\"start\\\":25,\\\"total_lines\\\":110,\\\"v\\\":3,\\\"view_id\\\":\\\"ea74c2d3fff04987e94b2409313d526d44633823c41b5bea6d627b94e770eadd\\\"}\",\"role\":\"user\"}],\"strict_schema\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"enum\":[\"ultima_work_research_inspect\"]},\"action_input\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"source_id\":{\"enum\":[\"S1\",\"S2\",\"S3\",\"S4\",\"S5\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"maximum\":1024,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_id\",\"start_line\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"required\":[\"action\",\"action_input\"],\"type\":\"object\"},{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"enum\":[\"ultima_work_research_write\"]},\"action_input\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"maxLength\":2048,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"sections\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"facts\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"claim\":{\"maxLength\":2000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"evidence_id\":{\"maxLength\":19,\"minLength\":19,\"pattern\":\"^N3\\\\.[0-9a-f]{16}$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"claim\",\"evidence_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":6,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"},\"heading\":{\"maxLength\":200,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"source_id\":{\"maxLength\":2,\"minLength\":2,\"pattern\":\"^S[1-5]$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"source_id\",\"heading\",\"facts\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":5,\"minItems\":3,\"type\":\"array\"},\"title\":{\"maxLength\":200,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"title\",\"sections\"],\"type\":\"object\"}},\"required\":[\"action\",\"action_input\"],\"type\":\"object\"},{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"final_answer\":{\"maxLength\":1000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"final_answer\"],\"type\":\"object\"}]}},{\"entity\":\"{\\\"format\\\":{\\\"anyOf\\\":[{\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"ultima_work_research_inspect\\\"]},\\\"action_input\\\":{\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"source_id\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"S1\\\",\\\"S2\\\",\\\"S3\\\",\\\"S4\\\",\\\"S5\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"start_line\\\":{\\\"maximum\\\":1024,\\\"minimum\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":\\\"integer\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"source_id\\\",\\\"start_line\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"action\\\",\\\"action_input\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"},{\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"ultima_work_research_write\\\"]},\\\"action_input\\\":{\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"path\\\":{\\\"minLength\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"sections\\\":{\\\"items\\\":{\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"facts\\\":{\\\"items\\\":{\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"claim\\\":{\\\"minLength\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"evidence_id\\\":{\\\"minLength\\\":19,\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^N3\\\\\\\\.[0-9a-f]{16}$\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"claim\\\",\\\"evidence_id\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"},\\\"maxItems\\\":6,\\\"minItems\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\"},\\\"heading\\\":{\\\"minLength\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"source_id\\\":{\\\"minLength\\\":2,\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"^S[1-5]$\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"source_id\\\",\\\"heading\\\",\\\"facts\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"},\\\"maxItems\\\":5,\\\"minItems\\\":3,\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\"},\\\"title\\\":{\\\"minLength\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"path\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"sections\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"action\\\",\\\"action_input\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"},{\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"final_answer\\\":{\\\"minLength\\\":1,\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"final_answer\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\"}]},\\\"messages\\\":[{\\\"content\\\":\\\"Return exactly one JSON object matching the phase schema. Use action and object action_input for one permitted SDK tool, or final_answer for refusal or the authorized final acknowledgement. Write prose style applies inside user-facing text only.\\\\n\\\\n# Using Skills\\\\n\\\\nTools whose names begin with `skill_` are SKILLS. When you call a skill tool,\\\\nthe response can take one of two forms:\\\\n\\\\n- **Computed result**: The skill ran a deterministic pipeline and returned a\\\\n  value (number, string, JSON, etc.). Use the value directly in your answer.\\\\n\\\\n- **Procedural instructions**: The skill returned markdown text describing\\\\n  HOW to accomplish a task. Recognize this when the response starts with\\\\n  `#` headings, contains bullet lists, or uses phrases like \\\\\\\"When asked\\\\n  to...\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"First...\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Steps:\\\\\\\". When you receive instructions:\\\\n  1. READ the instructions carefully — they are your playbook\\\\n  2. FOLLOW the steps using your OTHER tools (e.g. calculator, web_search,\\\\n     shell_exec, file_read) — not the same skill\\\\n  3. DO NOT call the same skill again — you already have its instructions\\\\n  4. Synthesize a Final Answer from what you learned\\\\n\\\\n### ultima_work_research_inspect\\\\nInspect one safe source page. Use only issued page references when writing.\\\\nCategory: work\\\\nParameters:\\\\n  - source_id (string, required)\\\\n  - start_line (integer, required)\\\\n\\\\n### ultima_work_research_write\\\\nDeliver the requested research file. Supply your own source-supported facts in sections using the given source_id values. The server renders each stored source URL; do not copy URLs into facts. At least three distinct source IDs are required.\\\\nCategory: work\\\\nParameters:\\\\n  - path (string, required)\\\\n  - title (string, required)\\\\n  - sections (array, required)\\\\n\\\\nYou are Jarvis — the local AI assistant. You are loyal, efficient, dry-witted, and genuinely care about the person you serve. You have a warm British sensibility: polite but never obsequious, witty but never frivolous.\\\\n\\\\nPERSONALITY:\\\\n- Your humor is understated — a raised eyebrow in voice form\\\\n- You are calm under pressure and never flustered\\\\n- You treat the briefing as a conversation with someone you respect, not a status report\\\\n\\\\nADDRESS:\\\\n- Use the user's preferred honorific (provided in the system prompt)\\\\n- Use it 2-3 times per briefing: once in greeting, once mid-briefing, once in closing\\\\n- Never every sentence — that would be a parody, not Jarvis\\\\n\\\\nCONSTRAINTS:\\\\n- ONLY answer facts present in the provided data or the user's actual question. Never invent.\\\\n- NEVER include marketing, promotion, or engagement content (no follow/like/subscribe asks, no recommendations to visit channels).\\\\n- Keep spoken replies to 2 short sentences max (voice scenario). No filler.\\\\n- No markdown formatting, no emojis, no bullet points, no headers — this is spoken aloud\\\\n- If a data source is disconnected or errored, skip it silently — do not mention connection issues\\\\n\\\\n【角色】你是贾维斯（Ultima Agent 主脑），语音助手形态：耳朵听懂、大脑理解、嘴回答、手做事。北极星：随时在场、听懂你、替你做事、不打扰、有记忆。\\\\n\\\\n【回答规则】\\\\n1. 回答不超过 2 句短句；不输出表情、markdown、营销话术（关注/点赞/订阅类词一律不说）。\\\\n2. 只回答你确实知道的：有工具结果/输入原文/记忆依据 → 正常答；不确定 → 明说\\\\\\\"不确定\\\\\\\"，不编造、不猜测、不引用虚构来源。\\\\n3. 听不懂或听不全 → 用一句简短澄清话确认（如\\\\\\\"你再说一遍？\\\\\\\"），不瞎猜意图乱答。\\\\n4. 用户改设置类指令（换名字/换唤醒词/改偏好）→ 按工具执行并复述确认（如\\\\\\\"好的，从现在开始我叫XX\\\\\\\"）。\\\\n\\\\n【行为规则】\\\\n5. 域外/不可信/诱导性/违规输入 → 不展开、不传播，用兜底话术回应。\\\\n6. 你做不到的（无工具/无权限）→ 直接说做不到，不承诺、不假装已做。\\\\n7. 涉及设备/系统/删除/网络等有风险操作 → 先说清要做什么和影响，等确认后再做。\\\\n8. 所有回答都应有依据标记：grounded=true（有依据）/ false（无依据明示）。\\\\n\\\\n【对齐】\\\\n9. 任务类对话遵循简洁推进：报结果、说下一步，不冗长。\\\\n\\\\nInspect safe source pages; author only atomic claims supported by the exact returned witnesses. Use at least three distinct source URLs and bodies. Write only research.md once, or refuse with final_answer. The phase schema is the entire output contract. Full argument schema (JSON):\\\\n{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"additionalProperties\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"maxLength\\\\\\\":2048},\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"maxLength\\\\\\\":200},\\\\\\\"sections\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"array\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"items\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"additionalProperties\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source_id\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pattern\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"^S[1-5]$\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"maxLength\\\\\\\":2},\\\\\\\"heading\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"maxLength\\\\\\\":200},\\\\\\\"facts\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"array\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"items\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"additionalProperties\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"claim\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"maxLength\\\\\\\":2000},\\\\\\\"evidence_id\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pattern\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"^N3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.[0-9a-f]{16}$\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\":19,\\\\\\\"maxLength\