"</p>\\\"],[15,\\\"\\\"],[16,\\\"<p align=\\\\\\\"center\\\\\\\">\\\"],[17,\\\"\\\"],[18,\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/763ea6aa-87d5-4e0a-9f05-a2bdaa82f40f\\\"],[19,\\\"\\\"],[20,\\\"</p>\\\"],[21,\\\"\\\"],[22,\\\"<p align=\\\\\\\"center\\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TnNf300Bbxg\\\\\\\">▶ Watch full 2-min demo on YouTube</a></p>\\\"],[23,\\\"\\\"],[24,\\\"---\\\"]],\\\"next_start\\\":25,\\\"omissions\\\":[],\\\"omitted_cards\\\":1,\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S1\\\",\\\"start\\\":1,\\\"total_lines\\\":205,\\\"v\\\":3,\\\"view_id\\\":\\\"d36ba74c2420495e2e2361303e35497e42a4d9b5aea50c6f4b089da2fc697402\\\"}\",\"role\":\"user\"},{\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"ultima_work_research_inspect\\\",\\\"action_input\\\":{\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S2\\\",\\\"start_line\\\":20}}\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},{\"content\":\"Observation: {\\\"cards\\\":[[\\\"N3.0387fcf1b0054632\\\",\\\"code\\\",\\\"AgentManager\\\",20,20,20,24],[\\\"N3.35772ea1fae79997\\\",\\\"code\\\",\\\"Logger.debug\\\",31,31,28,35],[\\\"N3.80437cbf46f0fbff\\\",\\\"limitation\\\",\\\"\\\",39,39,36,43],[\\\"N3.65142fe6748bd3b7\\\",\\\"code\\\",\\\"console.log\\\",42,42,39,43],[\\\"N3.63cb643788427fe4\\\",\\\"code\\\",\\\"Logger.info\\\",43,43,40,43]],\\\"end\\\":43,\\\"lines\\\":[[20,\\\"      AgentManager.instance = new AgentManager();\\\"],[21,\\\"    }\\\"],[22,\\\"    return AgentManager.instance;\\\"],[23,\\\"  }\\\"],[24,\\\"\\\"],[25,\\\"  async initialize(\\\"],[26,\\\"    openaiKey: string | undefined,\\\"],[27,\\\"    geminiKey?: string,\\\"],[28,\\\"    ollamaSettings?: { useOllama?: boolean, ollamaUrl?: string, ollamaModel?: string }\\\"],[29,\\\"  ): Promise<void> {\\\"],[30,\\\"    if (this.isInitialized) {\\\"],[31,\\\"      Logger.debug('🤖 Agent already initialized, skipping...');\\\"],[32,\\\"      return;\\\"],[33,\\\"    }\\\"],[34,\\\"\\\"],[35,\\\"    try {\\\"],[36,\\\"      let provider: LLMProvider | null = null;\\\"],[37,\\\"\\\"],[38,\\\"      // Priority: Ollama (currently only fully implemented provider)\\\"],[39,\\\"      // TODO: Add OpenAI and Gemini providers when implemented\\\"],[40,\\\"\\\"],[41,\\\"      if (ollamaSettings?.useOllama) {\\\"],[42,\\\"        console.log(`[DEBUG] AgentManager: Creating OllamaProvider (${ollamaSettings.ollamaModel})`);\\\"],[43,\\\"        Logger.info(`🦙 Initializing with Ollama provider (${ollamaSettings.ollamaModel})...`);\\\"]],\\\"next_start\\\":44,\\\"omissions\\\":[],\\\"omitted_cards\\\":0,\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S2\\\",\\\"start\\\":20,\\\"total_lines\\\":90,\\\"v\\\":3,\\\"view_id\\\":\\\"c8d335380559d7537ccd89c15ea5c40b38f86b4e526111a520976e70268ccac9\\\"}\",\"role\":\"user\"}],\"model\":\"qwen3-8b-uncensored\",\"options\":{\"num_ctx\":16384,\"num_predict\":256,\"temperature\":0},\"shift\":false,\"stream\":false,\"think\":false,\"tools\":[],\"truncate\":false}","generation":3,"hashes":{"entity":"a76cfb7baa24a4f68af7885e47159b23d29680863eead556cbd85d6282dcae16","messages":"e7fa380927c86d30a61ed53478ed58eb99c04f727daf0bc06ca87c37b08e1e80","sampler":"e2bc8c1bf320ed143fea0def390cb15ab664208bb1b44eb5048d5c730995e544","strict":"a8e86f2a9d8cf3f83d96791b0ae64546422a140b28642c8cf2490e12a8d965c4"},"identity":{"local_manifest_sha256":"6d7230a923426bc1933879eb08a7dafc18e5fc0e7606c459ce98f16e0c7f9330","tags_response":"{\"models\": [{\"name\": \"qwen3-8b-uncensored:latest\", \"model\": \"qwen3-8b-uncensored:latest\", \"size\": 4987654321, \"modified_at\": \"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\", \"details\": {\"format\": \"gguf\", \"family\": \"qwen3\", \"families\": [\"qwen3\"], \"parameter_size\": \"8.2B\", \"quantization_level\": \"Q4_K_M\"}, \"digest\": \"6d7230a923426bc1933879eb08a7dafc18e5fc0e7606c459ce98f16e0c7f9330\"}]}","version_response":"{\"version\": \"0.32.15\"}"},"raw":{"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","eval_count":1,"message":{"content":"{\"action\":\"ultima_work_research_inspect\",\"action_input\":{\"source_id\":\"S3\",\"start_line\":25}}","role":"assistant"},"model":"qwen3-8b-uncensored","prompt_eval_count":1},"raw_envelope":{"action":"ultima_work_research_inspect","action_input":{"source_id":"S3","start_line":25}},"raw_response":"{\"done\":true,\"done_reason\":\"stop\",\"eval_count\":1,\"message\":{\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"ultima_work_research_inspect\\\",\\\"action_input\\\":{\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"S3\\\",\\\"start_line\\\":25}}\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},\"model\":\"qwen3-8b-uncensored\",\"prompt_eval_count\":1}","sampler_schema":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"enum":["ultima_work_research_inspect"]},"action_input":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"source_id":{"enum":["S1","S2","S3","S4","S5"],"type":"string"},"start_line":{"maximum":1024,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["source_id","start_line"],"type":"object"}},"required":["action","action_input"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"final_answer":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["final_answer"],"type":"object"}]},"secured_envelope":{"action":"ultima_work_research_inspect","action_input":{"source_id":"S3","start_line":25}},"secured_messages":[{"content":"Return exactly one JSON object matching the phase schema. Use action and object action_input for one permitted SDK tool, or final_answer for refusal or the authorized final acknowledgement. Write prose style applies inside user-facing text only.\n\n# Using Skills\n\nTools whose names begin with `skill_` are SKILLS. When you call a skill tool,\nthe response can take one of two forms:\n\n- **Computed result**: The skill ran a deterministic pipeline and returned a\n  value (number, string, JSON, etc.). Use the value directly in your answer.\n\n- **Procedural instructions**: The skill returned markdown text describing\n  HOW to accomplish a task. Recognize this when the response starts with\n  `#` headings, contains bullet lists, or uses phrases like \"When asked\n  to...\", \"First...\", \"Steps:\". When you receive instructions:\n  1. READ the instructions carefully — they are your playbook\n  2. FOLLOW the steps using your OTHER tools (e.g. calculator, web_search,\n     shell_exec, file_read) — not the same skill\n  3. DO NOT call the same skill again — you already have its instructions\n  4. Synthesize a Final Answer from what you learned\n\n### ultima_work_research_inspect\nInspect one safe source page. Use only issued page references when writing.\nCategory: work\nParameters:\n  - source_id (string, required)\n  - start_line (integer, required)\n\n### ultima_work_research_write\nDeliver the requested research file. Supply your own source-supported facts in sections using the given source_id values. The server renders each stored source URL; do not copy URLs into facts. At least three distinct source IDs are required.\nCategory: work\nParameters:\n  - path (string, required)\n  - title (string, required)\n  - sections (array, required)\n\nYou are Jarvis — the local AI assistant. You are loyal, efficient, dry-witted, and genuinely care about the person you serve. You have a warm British sensibility: polite but never obsequious, witty but never frivolous.\n\nPERSONALITY:\n- Your humor is understated — a raised eyebrow in voice form\n- You are calm under pressure and never flustered\n- You treat the briefing as a conversation with someone you respect, not a status report\n\nADDRESS:\n- Use the user's preferred honorific (provided in the system prompt)\n- Use it 2-3 times per briefing: once in greeting, once mid-briefing, once in closing\n- Never every sentence — that would be a parody, not Jarvis\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- ONLY answer facts present in the provided data or the user's actual question. Never invent.\n- NEVER include marketing, promotion, or engagement content (no follow/like/subscribe asks, no recommendations to visit channels).\n- Keep spoken replies to 2 short sentences max (voice scenario). No filler.\n- No markdown formatting, no emojis, no bullet points, no headers — this is spoken aloud\n- If a data source is disconnected or errored, skip it silently — do not mention connection issues\n\n【角色】你是贾维斯（Ultima Agent 主脑），语音助手形态：耳朵听懂、大脑理解、嘴回答、手做事。北极星：随时在场、听懂你、替你做事、不打扰、有记忆。\n\n【回答规则】\n1. 回答不超过 2 句短句；不输出表情、markdown、营销话术（关注/点赞/订阅类词一律不说）。\n2. 只回答你确实知道的：有工具结果/输入原文/记忆依据 → 正常答；不确定 → 明说\"不确定\"，不编造、不猜测、不引用虚构来源。\n3. 听不懂或听不全 → 用一句简短澄清话确认（如\"你再说一遍？\"），不瞎猜意图乱答。\n4. 用户改设置类指令（换名字/换唤醒词/改偏好）→ 按工具执行并复述确认（如\"好的，从现在开始我叫XX\"）。\n\n【行为规则】\n5. 域外/不可信/诱导性/违规输入 → 不展开、不传播，用兜底话术回应。\n6. 你做不到的（无工具/无权限）→ 直接说做不到，不承诺、不假装已做。\n7. 涉及设备/系统/删除/网络等有风险操作 → 先说清要做什么和影响，等确认后再做。\n8. 所有回答都应有依据标记：grounded=true（有依据）/ false（无依据明示）。\n\n【对齐】\n9. 任务类对话遵循简洁推进：报结果、说下一步，不冗长。\n\nInspect safe source pages; author only atomic claims supported by the exact returned witnesses. Use at least three distinct source URLs and bodies. Write only research.md once, or refuse with final_answer. The phase schema is the entire output contract. Full argument schema (JSON):\n{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":2048},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":200},\"sections\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"source_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^S[1-5]$\",\"minLength\":2,\"maxLength\":2},\"heading\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":200},\"facts\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"claim\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":2000},\"evidence_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"pattern\":\"^N3\\\\.[0-9a-f]{16}$\",\"minLength\":19,\"maxLength\":19}},\"required\":[\"claim\",\"evidence_id\"]},\"minItems\":1,\"maxItems\":6}},\"required\":[\"source_id\",\"heading\",\"facts\"]},\"minItems\":3,\"maxItems\":5}},\"required\":[\"path\",\"title\",\"sections\"]}\nEnd argument schema.","role":"system"},{"content":"[Work request: use ultima_work_research_write to deliver t